{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interview met Wim Barneveld, Nel Barneveld-Schelling en Hans Schelling, 5 februari 2025"},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"D. Vijverberg"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/ror.org\/027bh9e22","expandedvalue":{"scheme":"http:\/\/www.grid.ac\/ontology\/","termName":"Leiden University","@type":"https:\/\/schema.org\/Organization"}}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vijverberg, David"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Voor mijn stageopdracht bij het Rijksdienst voor het Cultureel Erfgoed (RCE) heb ik een verhaal geschreven over de levensloop van de architect H.G.J. Schelling in relatie tot zijn werk. Deze stage heb ik optioneel gedaan voor 10 ECTS binnen de Master Europe 1000-1800 aan de Universiteit Leiden. Als onderdeel van mijn stageopdracht heb ik op 5 februari 2025 een interview afgelegd met twee kleinkinderen van Schelling, Hans Schelling en Nel Barneveld-Schelling, én Nel haar man, Wim Barneveld. Ik heb dit interview afgelegd bij Nel en Hans thuis, in Groningen. Dit heb ik samen gedaan met mijn stagebegeleider van het RCE, Hendrik-Jan Tolboom. Dit interview is relevant omdat het informatie geeft over Schellings persoonlijke leven, iets waar weinig over verteld wordt en bekend is in publicaties."}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"H.G.J. Schelling"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Auguste Perret"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gerrit Rietveld"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Frank Lloyd Wright"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Utrecht"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Heerlen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"treinstations"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"spoorwegen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NS"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De Inktpot"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"keramiek"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"grafiek"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"grafische vormgeving"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sybold van Ravesteyn"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2025-02-05"},{"typeName":"productionPlace","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Groningen"]},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"co